<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-inner">
<div class="kicker">Gift 04 · Future Blueprint</div>
<div class="house"></div>
<h1>A life we're<br>still designing.</h1>
<p>
Not a checklist. Not a promise that everything will happen exactly this way.
Just the places, machines, rooms, adventures, work and little ordinary moments
that make the future feel worth building.
</p>
<div class="scroll">FOLLOW THE BLUEPRINT ↓</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="blueprint">
<div class="heading">
<h2>The Future Plan</h2>
<span>18 BLUEPRINT POINTS</span>
</div>

<div class="route">

<article class="station" style="--accent:#c49479;--wash:#f3e2d6" data-id="01">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">01 · FIRST DESTINATION</div>
<h3>Places We Still Want To Discover</h3>
<p>The honeymoon coordinate. The first big “we actually made it” destination — walking through the gates together instead of only talking about the trip.</p>
<div class="detail-line">PLAN TYPE · HONEYMOON</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="station" style="--accent:#91a99a;--wash:#e3eee7" data-id="02">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">02 · MOUNTAINS</div>
<h3>The Life We Want To Experience</h3>
<p>Cold air, mountains, beautiful roads and enough time to slow down and actually experience the place rather than rushing through it.</p>
<div class="detail-line">PLAN TYPE · TRAVEL</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="station" style="--accent:#a78eaa;--wash:#eee5f0" data-id="03">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">03 · TWO WHEELS</div>
<h3>Adventures We Haven't Planned Yet</h3>
<p>A proper road adventure: bikes, mountain passes, unpredictable weather, roadside chai and the kind of exhaustion that becomes a story.</p>
<div class="detail-line">PLAN TYPE · ROAD TRIP</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="station" style="--accent:#b99679;--wash:#f1e6da" data-id="04">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">04 · FOUNDATION</div>
<h3>The Space We Want To Build</h3>
<p>A home that feels peaceful rather than impressive. Our corners, our routines, our things, our food, our lazy days and a place that feels completely ours.</p>
<div class="detail-line">PLAN TYPE · HOME</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="station" style="--accent:#8ea3b1;--wash:#e3edf2" data-id="05">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">05 · GARAGE</div>
<h3>The Things We Want To Earn</h3>
<p>The driver's-car chapter. The machine that belongs on the dream list because some dreams are simply meant to make you smile when you turn the key.</p>
<div class="detail-line">PLAN TYPE · DREAM CAR</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="station" style="--accent:#9a9f7c;--wash:#e9eadb" data-id="06">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">06 · ADVENTURE MACHINE</div>
<h3>The Freedom We Want To Create</h3>
<p>The other side of the garage: something made for long roads, rough roads, road trips and places where the road eventually stops.</p>
<div class="detail-line">PLAN TYPE · DREAM CAR</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="station" style="--accent:#bd8f91;--wash:#f2dfdf" data-id="07">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">07 · WORK</div>
<h3>The Work We Want To Be Proud Of</h3>
<p>Turn years of learning, mistakes and late nights into something real — work that creates value instead of only filling a calendar.</p>
<div class="detail-line">PLAN TYPE · AMBITION</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="station" style="--accent:#8da89e;--wash:#e0ede7" data-id="08">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">08 · CRAFT</div>
<h3>The Skills We Want To Master</h3>
<p>Keep learning until difficult things become normal. Skills first, reputation later, and never stop becoming better at the work.</p>
<div class="detail-line">PLAN TYPE · GROWTH</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="station" style="--accent:#a793b0;--wash:#ece4ef" data-id="09">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">09 · FREEDOM</div>
<h3>The Independence We Want To Earn</h3>
<p>Create enough stability that choices become wider: helping family, travelling, building, experimenting and saying yes to opportunities.</p>
<div class="detail-line">PLAN TYPE · INDEPENDENCE</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="station" style="--accent:#c19a7e;--wash:#f1e3d8" data-id="10">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">10 · FAMILY</div>
<h3>The People We Want To Make Proud</h3>
<p>A future isn't only about what we own. It's also about becoming the kind of people our families can rely on and feel proud of.</p>
<div class="detail-line">PLAN TYPE · PEOPLE</div>
</div>
</article>

<article class="station" style="--accent:#8ea69a;--wash:#e4eee8" data-id="11">
<div class="node"></div>
<div class="blueprint-piece">
<div class="plan-mark blueprint-unified-logo blueprint-unified-logo"></div>
<div class="phase">11 · SMALL DAYS</div>
<h3>The Ordinary Days We Want To Have</h3>
<p>Breakfast. Work. Someone being sleepy. Someone taking too long to get ready. The completely normal days that quietly become the best part.</p>
